      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KIMCHI (4) turned in a good effort last time out when he led as favourite and fought on as runner-up at Stawell, beaten a nose. Draws wider but comes back in grade. With his A-game he can take out a race like this. THEROUX (6) was hampered by a flat tyre so did well to finish fourth last start at Kilmore. Draws well but could measure up here. NORMANDY NUGGET (1) led from a couple of spots wider when resuming at Stawell but couldn't see it out. Fitter so can give a sight from the inside draw. TOPHUT JOHNY (5) was a Kilmore winner earlier in this month and owns a good record at this circuit and distance.",
